{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000392","compactId":"SO_0000392","id":"SO:0000392","label":"U2_snRNA","definition":{"text":"U2 is a small nuclear RNA (snRNA) component of the spliceosome (involved in pre-mRNA splicing). Complementary binding between U2 snRNA (in an area lying towards the 5' end but 3' to hairpin I) and the branchpoint sequence (BPS) of the intron results in the bulging out of an unpaired adenine, on the BPS, which initiates a nucleophilic attack at the intronic 5' splice site, thus starting the first of two transesterification reactions that mediate splicing.","xrefs":["http://www.sanger.ac.uk/cgi-bin/Rfam/getacc?RF00004"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"U2 small nuclear RNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"U2 snRNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"small nuclear RNA U2"},{"scope":"exact","value":"snRNA U2"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U2_snRNA"],"subsets":["SOFA"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000392/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: U2_snRNA","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0000274"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0000274"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0000274","SO:0002247","SO:0000655","SO:0000233","SO:0000673","S